Implements the StorefrontBackend and MerchantBackend contract of Anthropic's reference
implementation, https://github.com/anthropics/commerce-agents (Copyright 2026 Anthropic
PBC, Apache License 2.0), and serves its example web apps. The merchant fixtures the
host can read (metrics history, campaigns, issues) come from that repository's
examples/retail/data at run time; nothing from it is redistributed here.
Vendored from that repository at commit fd4d592, unchanged, so the package runs without a
checkout of it:
- src/demo_common/: the example host routes, session store and fixture loaders
  (examples/demo_common, Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC);
- src/commerce_medusa/skills/: the shopping and merchant agent skills
  (shopping-agent/skills, merchant-agent/skills);
- src/commerce_medusa/data/retail/: the retail example fixtures (examples/retail/data),
  seed data and the merchant's metrics history.
platform/medusa-backend/ holds two files for a Medusa v2 application created with
create-medusa-app (Medusa, MIT).
